WEBVTT

00:09:57.532 --> 00:10:00.754
Vi ger dem också mod
så att de vågar uppfylla sina drömmar

00:10:00.778 --> 00:10:03.066
i den verkliga världen, i realtid.

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:04.249
Tack.

00:10:04.273 --> 00:10:07.251
(Applåder)

00:10:07.645 --> 00:10:09.096
Tack.

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:12.107
(Applåder)